{"version":1,"content":"<p>昔日憑《還珠格格》「小燕子」一角紅遍兩岸三地的女星趙薇，自2021年8月突傳遭內地全網封殺、作品慘被下架後，便淡出大眾視野。</p><p>神隱多時的她，日前罕有現身新加坡，出席國際頂尖髮型設計大師Kim Robinson的髮型騷。</p><p>狀態大勇的她更接受當地傳</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T10:22:18.300360+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T10:01:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T10:18:34.174564+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T10:18:34.174564+00:00","content_hash":"0537023986440055650d395cae773b2e42254de1d44a26d0910290035c02e69d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}